# Production environment variables for VPS
# Copy entire secrets/ directory to /opt/10xcards/secrets/ on VPS

# This file shows what environment variables are needed.
# The actual values should be in secrets/supabase.env and secrets/app.env on VPS.

# Note: SUPABASE_URL should be "http://kong:8000" for internal Docker networking
# The app will connect to Supabase services running in the same Docker network.

